[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 602.63, "timestamp": "00:10:02", "text": "你知道，有些事情很奇怪，没关系，不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 607.03, "timestamp": "00:10:07", "text": "担心？是啊，这是你的接管，所以……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 618.23, "timestamp": "00:10:18", "text": "好的，对我好点，别担心，他们会的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 619.79, "timestamp": "00:10:19", "text": "如果他们不友好，我会照顾好自己。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 621.389, "timestamp": "00:10:21", "text": "它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 625.55, "timestamp": "00:10:25", "text": "嗨，查德，我毫不犹豫。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 629.03, "timestamp": "00:10:29", "text": "不像J那样，我会说这番废话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 643.629, "timestamp": "00:10:43", "text": "请问我能买到和这个一样的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 647.389, "timestamp": "00:10:47", "text": "不过，这猎鹰之眼狙击枪到底是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 649.03, "timestamp": "00:10:49", "text": "猎鹰一号"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 651.03, "timestamp": "00:10:51", "text": "狙击手，这个是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 655.87, "timestamp": "00:10:55", "text": "我觉得那也是黄金，没错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 657.87, "timestamp": "00:10:57", "text": "无论我唯一担心的是什么"}]